# services

## Назначение

Imperative API без React: singletons, registry, side-effect coordinators.

## Структура

```
{feature}/
├── index.ts
├── service.ts
├── service.interface.ts
└── service.enums.ts          ← optional
```

## index.ts

```ts
export { alertsService, type Alert, type AlertsServiceProps };

export namespace AlertsService {
  export type Props = AlertsServiceProps;
  export const ENUMS = { Type: AlertType };
}
```

## service.ts

- Module-level singleton или factory
- Methods mutate external refs (Toast manager from provider)
- **Не** import React components

## Provider wiring

Provider registers service on mount:

```ts
useEffect(() => {
  alertsService.manager(manager);
  return () => alertsService.manager(null);
}, [manager]);
```

## Interface

- `service.interface.ts` — public method signatures, DTO types
- Enums в `service.enums.ts` — export через namespace `ENUMS`

## Правила

1. Service — single responsibility domain (alerts, storage)
2. **Не** UI в service
3. Testable: inject dependencies через setter (`manager(null)`)

## Эталоны

- `src/services/alerts/` — Toast manager registry
- `src/services/storage/local/` — localStorage wrapper
- `src/services/storage/cookie/` — cookie wrapper
